Subject: [PATCH] SCH-108: Explain missing quota policy from the current
 admission

Project the real ErrQuotaUnconfigured decision to a fixed configure_quota_policy action with no inferred capacity. Keep wrapped error identity and reject equal-text historical errors as fresh evidence.

Verified the typed and wrapped decision unit cases with -race. Disconnected PostgreSQL 18.6 verified absent policy without queue reads or holds, actual policy installation and a same-job retry with no stale guidance. The two targeted cases passed in waitreason.KmztTZiN. Production training consumers and the public flow remain open; no training file or production DDL changed.
